policy.description:
@lex_node @bitcoincashCN @THORChain Nodes == validators. There are currently 95 active validators/nodes on the THORChain network: https://t.co/W5tUlyMFiS

But importantly, validators are organized every keygen ceremony into "asgard" vaults. These are the MPC vaults that actually custody funds. Currently the target membership of vaults is 20 validators. In order to sign out a transaction, a supermajority of those 20 validators must sign the transaction, so effectively 14/20.  You can view vault membership and custodied funds here: https://t.co/IMHHMqAU4R

and list of validators here: https://t.co/Y605nk3Ngo

