@KTOP_Pool @adamKDean @bosconfts @Cryptofly777 @LucasMacchia2 I've voted Abstain a proposal that potentially benefit Iagon

Rationale on Integration for Cardano

"This is much needed in Cardano. Iagon would be directly benefit from this by getting the Fireblocks integration reimbursed, this is the reason for the Abstain vote. \n\nHowever, I would ask others to ask more details about the 3.5M ADA for legal, compliance and admin costs. This is in my view way too much for this. At worst, one contract would cost potentially 30-50k USD. I don't see how this can be 3.5M ADA."

